<p>This is where I’ll post short, informal notes — a neat result from a simulation, a debugging story, a paper I liked and why, conference takeaways. Nothing here is peer-reviewed; treat it as a lab notebook, not a publication.</p>
<p>For the group’s actual publications, CV, and research overview, see the <a href="https://giuseppetorri.com">main lab site</a>.</p>
